        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1609, Wood Door Silencer 5 Pack</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis door cushioning rubber is for use on <b>Wood Door Frames</b>.  The dark gray rubber cushion push into a  1/4\" diameter hole that is drilled in a wood door frame. Normally used on commercial doors that have a <a href=\"/collections/closer\">door closer</a> to silence the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/metal-door-silencer-rubber-5-pack-don-jo-1608\"><b>Metal Door Cushion</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/adhesive-door-silencer-rubber-10-pack-don-jo-1610\"><b>Self Adhesive Cushion</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1609_size.gif?v=1704354737\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1609 Door Silencer\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIt is recommended using 2 or more per door to prevent the door from warping.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 1609 Door Silencer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cushion Head Size: 3/4\" (.750) x  3/8\" (.400)</li>\r\n<li>Cushion Head Thickness: 5/32\" (.150)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11/32\" (.700)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Dark Gray Rubber</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1609.pdf?v=1704262264\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1609 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as Five (5) Pack. </b>\r\n</p>",
